sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as monitor.py<br/>(on-prem server)
    participant DC as Domain controller<br/>(DNS)
    participant P as pfSense
    participant G as Azure VPN Gateway<br/>(hub)
    participant A as API (Flask)<br/>App Service (spoke)
    participant S as Azure SQL Database<br/>(private endpoint)
    M->>M: Measure CPU, memory, disk
    M->>DC: What is the IP of the API?
    DC-->>M: Private IP in the spoke (10.20.2.x)
    M->>P: POST /measurements + X-API-Key (HTTPS)
    P->>G: Encrypted IPsec tunnel (AES-256)
    G->>A: Through the peering and the NSG (port 443)
    A->>A: Check API key and validate data
    alt Wrong or missing key
        A-->>M: 401 Unauthorized
    else Invalid data
        A-->>M: 400 Bad Request
    else Valid
        A->>S: INSERT measurement (managed identity, port 1433)
        S-->>A: OK
        A-->>M: 201 Created (stored: 1)
    end
    A->>A: Write request to the log
